  "body": "I'm implementing CSS `conic-gradient` in Gecko and I had noticed we don't have `CanvasRenderingContext2D.createConicGradient`, despite having the equivalents for radial and linear gradients.\r\n\r\nImplementation-wise, it wouldn't be much work on top of CSS `conic-gradient`.\r\nSpec-wise, I suspect it would end up similar to `createLinearGradient`/`createRadialGradient`.\r\n\r\n(It's also worth noting we don't have `<conicGradient>` for SVG either, but that's not a problem for this spec) ",
